> Can't we start respecting those values/flags also, when using `--web`? GitHub does support setting them using query params.

@AliabbasMerchant Thanks for sharing that; I've learned something new! Last time I've checked, only `title` and `body` were supported in query parameters. 🙈 

Seeing how the rest of the parameters are supported too, I would be thrilled if you could add support for them being forwarded in `--web` mode. It does not look like reviewers are supported, so maybe we should consider warning or raising an error if the person tries to do `gh pr create -r <user> --web`, similar to how we do with `--draft`.
